  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY:\nTransitive ({他動詞|たどうし})\n\nCOMPOUND VERB:\n{磨|みが}く (to polish/brush) + {上|あ}げる (to finish/complete)\nThe {上|あ}げる adds completion or bringing to perfection.\n\nSENSE 1 (Physical):\n- {床|ゆか}/{窓|まど}/{靴|くつ}を{磨|みが}き{上|あ}げる\n- Often results in something shiny (ピカピカ)\n\nSENSE 2 (Figurative):\n- {技術|ぎじゅつ}/{腕|うで}/{才能|さいのう}を{磨|みが}き{上|あ}げる\n- Used for skills, abilities, artistic qualities\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {磨|みが}く (to polish, to brush)\n- {鍛|きた}え{上|あ}げる (to train thoroughly)\n- {仕上|しあ}げる (to finish, to complete)",
